          "note": "Blocmates' 2026 Macro Catalyst Roadmap explicitly argues that liquidity cycles now override protocol-specific catalysts for BTC and increasingly for large-cap DeFi, meaning a technically sound roadmap can underperform if macro conditions shift before launch.",
          "source": ""
        }
